134
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:30,400
2 HORAS E MEIA
APÓS O AVISTAMENTO

135
00:10:30,401 --> 00:10:32,338
Entrevistamos todas
as testemunhas,

136
00:10:32,339 --> 00:10:34,891
